|> 
|> SO, what I am looking for is a list of assorted tricks to speed up the game.
|> (Like loading only TSRs you _really_ need.).
|> I am 100% sure there are lots of others who would really appreciate all
|> such hints. Even so much you could make a FAQ of it...

How to make NH run fast!

   Use Dos 5.0 or Dr-Dos 6.0
   Use an expanded memory manager
   Have memory.  2 Meg is about the dividing line between slow and fast
   If you have a 386, use the DJGPP version.
   If you have > 2 Meg and using the Microsloth version, then set up
      a ~1 Meg cache.  (This is not needed on the DJGPP version)

